{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"According to. What.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:16.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669111173546024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Translator's note: Keikukudh means Kukudh's plan.`","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:28.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669159164772372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I think it's a Grung word.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:29.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669163329847306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Nope. Never heard of it.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:35.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669191427752016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'If I had to guess, it'd be Infernal.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:49.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669247454740500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I. Speak infernal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:27:59.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669291103682579","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Orphy can speak Infern.... oh, right.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:28:04.487000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669311959072789","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Uh, yeah. We most definitely all are that.\" Roy replies to Irynx, before sweeping some pie off his clothes with his hands and letting the bugs have some of the leftovers. \"Whatever that is, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:28:12.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669347262529538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'So that's a no, then... It can't be the weird language I used to know, it doesn't sound the same and we don't understand it any more...'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:28:56.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669528095883264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sabby can help you clean up,\" as she munches on an egg custard pie.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:28:59.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669542783418369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
