{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...Sabby? That's a new one.' she goes to help Roy by prestidigitating anything the bugs don't eat.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:29:35.802000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669694960631859","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I just made it up because it sounds cute.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:29:58.811000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669791468290048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Mictlan carefully begins eating a pie made almost entirely out of hot peppers.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:30:18.406000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867669873655021578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she makes a strange squeaking noise, puffing out her cheeks.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:31:02.687000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670059384438794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"They pause. \"What.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:32:06.835000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670328440651806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Oh yeah, she does that sometimes. Guess it's a frog thing.`","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:32:27.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670414994047027","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`It's cute. And she used to be so scared of being intimidating, and now look at her.`","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:32:43.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670481262739496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Mortals,\" they say approvingly.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:33:02.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670561903083530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Anyway, uh, now that that's over with.\" Irynx prestidigitates all the whipped cream from her hair. \"I just found out that a lot of people died around me these past few days, so I just wanted to know. And I'm sorry about not noticing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:33:36.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670705603870720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh,\" they say with some surprise. \"Yes. That is. Okay. I was basically. Sent here. To die. Anyway. And I became. Quickly. Un-deaded.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:34:46.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867670999620386817","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...so am I the only person who's LESS dead than they started?'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:35:28.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671175810514944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Probably.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:35:50.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671264503922688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Con. Gratulations?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:35:59.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671303879786507","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You still had to die to get less dead though.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:36:23.441000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671404722651156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'It's still... Difficult to get used to this. But I feel like... me, and not just a persona to hide behind.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:36:34.338000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671450428375040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What is a. Persona.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:36:52.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671527448510494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`You know Astral Self Monks, right?`","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:17.060000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671629616906240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"That's just what you call someone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:19.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671639168253963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I don't have to worry about being rejected or killed due to someone discovering my being a corpse.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:43.384000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671740028420096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You can. Hide behind. Yourself?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:43.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671740841852938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'In a way.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:47.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671758261583872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"How can you be killed. If you are. A corpse?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:37:55.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671789009108992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Ask the ravens that one.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:38:17.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671883289198642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy shrugs. \"Some folks from back home learned how to use their swarms as cover, and with swarms being part of us, I suppose that would count as hiding behind yourself in a way?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:38:25.213000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867671915472748554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she takes a deep breath. '...I need to tell you all something. I'm sorry for deceiving you for so long.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:38:48.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672011232509972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It's okay.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:38:54.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672039838056448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Mictlan nods hesitantly.","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:39:10.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672107235409960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You weren't doing it to be mean.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:39:11.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672107566366721","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"That makes it not a bad thing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:39:18.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672137972449290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she hesitates. 'My real name isn't Sabrine Lovlatar and I'm not a lady. I'm just... Sab Louhi, an ordinary person. I'm used to Sabrine by now, I like it, but still...'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:39:56.490000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672298315710524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hey! Who said you were ordinary?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:40:18.600000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672391051771924","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I mean, not like it's a bad thing to be. But I still think *for you*, that's the wrong word to use.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:40:43.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672496970661898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"The way I see it,\" they say, happily, \"Nobody is. Ordinary. Some people are. Just. More noticed than others.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:41:06.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672590323810344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I'm not anything special compared to... well, all of you. I was hoping the noble persona would ward off people getting too close, but...' she looks up at Roy. 'That. Didn't quite work out. I already told him, but I've been too scared to tell everyone else.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:41:34.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672707750821889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you want to ward people off, an effective trick is to tell them about the Swarm in detail.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:42:27.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672930871410718","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Objectively speaking, you're plenty extraordinary, Sabby.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T07:42:35.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867672965549391873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
